{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many base 10 four-digit numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db4e45c6c30a0464888fc3a9eac375c121ed5d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = \\underline{a} \\underline{b} \\underline{c} \\underline{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />, satisfy all three of the following conditions?\n</p><p>(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/e/94e6dee5af8140a8c57764028711388242f3adfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4,000 \\leq N &lt; 6,000;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" /> (ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a multiple of 5; (iii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/923573914a29252c496a79b1f5e1cda65d971fd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\leq b &lt; c \\leq 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/b/32b89f08c1238383a886aeadf25fe123d3c78b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 10 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 18 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 24 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 36 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 48 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>For condition (i), the restriction is put on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9bb6899775423492145a658c24b0543d3f0c11a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N&lt;4000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/3/333f869bd6cbeb14b20b71bbb69465bc89892e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a93b6aff96299500d79f8d70f10636c1838a1da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N \\ge 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c5a421e691e6d53a61ac8ee0c3ee64774d7ba3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d919cae222528f12950304681a0dfa1a82e41ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />.</li>\n<li>For condition (ii), the restriction is put on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; it must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a807b57842088af564fbc6889fb4e9ebf53c34c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=0,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />.</li>\n<li>For condition (iii), the restriction is put on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. The possible ordered pairs of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97fadfe6bdbd1adb164f263b52f2a290723ad45c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f431d7e58fc836be21857261dc5b01d34f860471.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bdab922049ed5ced6b8202f91456dcc1124904c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/13024a0315860c34295015e78900f6a007868ee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,5), (4,6),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/3/df31aab5248061c363b01df940edf0f39f924377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5,6),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" /> and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of them. Alternatively, we are picking from the four digits 3, 4, 5, 6, and for every combination of two, there is exactly one way to arrange them in increasing order, so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f401413a5807bd29f485f438f9b97173ecd58351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{4}{2} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"70\" height=\"53\" /> choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> when we consider them together.</li></ul>\n<p>Multiplying the possibilities for each restriction, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10cbd52803c01b3fdcef035aa9f528dc7ad7c6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 6=24\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016190923\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 208/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5135/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.904      1 -total\n 59.64%    8.293      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 38.51%    5.354      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6203:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016190923 and revision id 191567. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}